Bottomdepth where the sample is taken.

@ps {"from":"BunnprøverLinjer","path":[{"name":"bunndyp","type":"Integer","cardinality":"1","taggedValues":{"SOSI_navn":"BUNNDYP"},"@i":10}]}';

